.TH do-harness 1  "do-harness 0.3.0 (02877a8-dirty 2026-10-16)" 
.SH NAME
do\-harness \- do\-harness agent execution harness CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdo\-harness\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
do\-harness agent execution harness CLI
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Workspace root override (default: walk up from cwd)
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Explicit path to do\-harness.toml
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress PASS/WARN verdict lines and the success footer
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Default evidence artifact path for verify (overrides the \-\-set default; an explicit \-\-evidence still wins)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Dry run without side effects
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
do\-harness version
Print CLI version information
.TP
do\-harness verify
Run computational sensors
.TP
do\-harness list
List sensor names
.TP
do\-harness explain
Explain which sensors the current change selects, without running them
.TP
do\-harness status
Report verification evidence freshness without running sensors
.TP
do\-harness pr
Deterministic PR analysis (read\-only; works in any git repository)
.TP
do\-harness skills
Inspect and select skills by progressive disclosure
.TP
do\-harness init-db
Apply pending database migrations
.TP
do\-harness seed
Seed invariants from plans/invariants.json
.TP
do\-harness init
Scaffold a harness workspace in a target directory
.TP
do\-harness task
Inspect and export task state
.TP
do\-harness trace
Record and list interaction traces
.TP
do\-harness distill
Extract a heuristic from a resolved trace into a skill. Review output against the anti\-AI\-slop checklist (.agents/skills/skill\-creator/references/anti_ai_slop.md)
.TP
do\-harness errors
Inspect and clear fail\-fast error signatures
.TP
do\-harness loc
Report line\-of\-code state for the 500\-LOC invariant
.TP
do\-harness split
Extract a large top\-level item into a sibling module
.TP
do\-harness eval
Validate skill structure and benchmark skill evals
.TP
do\-harness hook
Manage git hooks that run `do\-harness verify`
.TP
do\-harness doctor
Run diagnostic checks on binary resolution and git hook health
.TP
do\-harness metrics
Report harness trends: sensor stats, strikes, eval pass\-rate history
.TP
do\-harness learn
Draft skill/guide updates from sensors that keep firing (never applies them)
.TP
do\-harness overlap
Rank skill pairs by guidance overlap (Tier\-2 distinctiveness advisory)
.TP
do\-harness maintenance
Prune old beats and compact the state database
.TP
do\-harness compliance
Print compliance mapping to OWASP Agentic Top 10, NIST AI RMF, and EU AI Act
.TP
do\-harness audit-chain
Recompute workflow event hash chain and report first divergence
.TP
do\-harness dora
Derive DORA deployment metrics from git history (deterministic, read\-only)
.TP
do\-harness ci-explain
Explain a CI run\*(Aqs failures and cancellations with local repro commands
.TP
do\-harness completions
Generate shell completions
.TP
do\-harness man
Generate man page documentation
.TP
do\-harness help
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  do\-harness init
  do\-harness hook install
  do\-harness verify \-\-record
  do\-harness verify \-\-record \-\-task <id>

Exit Codes:
  0  Success
  1  Verification or check failure
  2  Usage, configuration, or environment error
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0 (02877a8\-dirty 2026\-10\-16)
